#~ "if there is a series of photos taken at the same location. Since the "
#~ "coordinates are memorized from one dialog call to another, it is as easy "
#~ "as clicking on <guilabel>OK</guilabel> to set the previous data to the "
#~ "current photo."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Koordinate mogu biti postavljene ručno sa dijalogom. Ovo pomaže ako je "
#~ "niz fotografija uslikano na istu lokaciju. Kako su koordinate zapamćene "
#~ "iz jednog dijaloga poziva na drugi, lako je kao i klik na <guilabel>OK</"
#~ "guilabel> da bi postavili prethodne podatke na tekuće fotografije."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Otherwise the location can be found and fixed iteratively with the "
#~ "displayed map. Click on the region of interest, zoom in, adjust location "
#~ "by clicking again, and so on until sufficient accuracy is achieved. The "
#~ "altitude must always be entered manually. The map can be switched between "
